r where some may contain unique threats and challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 unique entities</strong> will try to stop or distract you and your unit from completing your goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disarm mines. (No two mines are ever the same!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity-based voice chat.</strong> Find and repair radio towers throughout the world to extend radio range for your unit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An infinitely scaling game loop,</strong> with an optional progression to complete the game if you can find the means to do so.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A status system </strong>built to always keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath.</strong> A save file can be loaded with any amount of players and will scale accordingly as long as you don't run out of funds.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Karbical"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716620/b2b8b473fd3aab99afda7a23bd3931a950908707/header.jpg?t=1769893231","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2716620/1399358361/691edb6ececf62ae7a351f229f7e701bd1e8b723/1755793734/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755873765","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2716620/1399358361/691edb6ececf62ae7a351f229f7e701bd1e8b723/1755793734/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755873765","highlight":true,"hls_h2